              "id": "overlay-companion-21",
              "text": "Supporting Your Child\n\nHelpful responses:\n“I’m here with you.”\n“That makes sense.”\n“You’re safe.”\n“You can always talk to me.”\n\nTry to avoid:\n“Don’t be sad”\n“You’re fine”\n“Be strong”\n\nClosing Message\n\nLove can grow again, even after loss.\n\nWith your presence, your child can learn they are safe, cared for, and not alone.",
